      <rules>
        <rule name="Ranger" id="7c5e-d190-b4c8-de9d" hidden="false">
          <description>A Mountain Guide is a dedicated tracker.
If he’s not put out of action in the battle, you may roll two dice for Exploration and pick one as the result.

Note that this is not a re-roll.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Loner" id="721d-ed95-262c-f597" hidden="false">
          <description>Mountain Guides are Ogre Hunters.
They become used to the solitude of the highest peaks in the Mountains of Mourn.

A Mountain Guide hunts the slopes alone and will never claim a Gnoblar or take one as a pet.

They are immune to All Alone tests and may never become the warband leader.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
